 ],
 "literal": "With a white bowl containing sweet honey / ... milking ... / With a green umbrella fashioned from a valley-leaf / plucking jasmine flowers from the bushes / Women with hands adorned with water-lily-like bangles / if they climb the hill and leap into the water / restraining the water through the outer gate / ... toddy sold for a price / The white paddy fields forming the fence of the great, generous Tittan / fine ornaments of great fame, like Urandai / even when offered, he does not accept, saying ... / ... of the young, tender Kino tree / with many fine beauty spots glowing with beaming brightness / and herself, who has breasts with dark nipples expanded / horses shaking at the small whip ... / ... indeed battle!",
 "translation": "With a white bowl filled with sweet honey, milking ..., with a green umbrella fashioned from a broad leaf of the valley, plucking jasmine flowers from the bushes, women wearing bangles shaped like water-lily stems climb the hill and leap into the water, which is then restrained at the outer sluice gate. In the land of the great and generous Tittan, whose white paddy fields serve as fences, even when offered fine ornaments of great fame like those of Urandai, he does not accept them. For her sake, whose breasts with dark nipples are expanded and adorned with many fine beauty spots glowing like the bright blossoms of a young, tender Kino tree, horses shake at the touch of the small whip, and indeed, battle is imminent!",
